 '【韩语关键词研究提示词】：I need Korean keywords for Korean e-commerce listing optimization. Product: [产品名+简要描述]. Please: 1. Generate 50+ Korean search terms that Korean shoppers would actually use 2. Categorize: core keywords (10), long-tail keywords (20), scenario-based keywords (10), competitor brand alternatives (10) 3. For each keyword, note estimated search volume tier (high/medium/low) 4. Note which keywords are used more on Naver vs Korean shopping platforms (may differ) 5. Suggest top 5 keywords for the title (most search volume + most relevant).',
 '【韩语Listing写作提示词】：Write a Korean e-commerce product listing in KOREAN. Product: [产品名 + 功能 + 卖点]. Target keywords: [关键词列表]. Requirements: 1. Title (max 80 characters): start with brand + core keyword + key features 2. 5 bullet points: each starts with a benefit headline in bold brackets 3. Detailed description: 300-500 words, naturally incorporate all keywords 4. Tone: friendly but professional, like a Korean e-commerce seller would write 5. Include common Korean selling phrases (e.g., "무료배송", "당일출고" if applicable) 6. Use proper Korean honorifics (해요체/존댓말) 7. Format: clearly labeled sections.',
 '【验证方法】：①用Naver数据实验室查关键词搜索量；②搜韩国电商平台同类Top10产品，看它们标题用什么词；③用平台的搜索下拉词和关联词功能验证。',
